  "__class__": "Meeting",
  "transcript": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": "00:16:31.910",
      "end": "00:16:33.160",
      "text": "Good afternoon, everyone."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": "00:16:33.160",
      "end": "00:16:36.670",
      "text": "Welcome to the 19th meeting of the Corporate Services Committee."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": "00:16:36.670",
      "end": "00:16:39.690",
      "text": "This is a special meeting."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": "00:16:39.690",
      "end": "00:16:41.220",
      "text": "I just wanted to advise colleagues of that."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": "00:16:41.220",
      "end": "00:16:47.200",
      "text": "So we will only be dealing with items that are on the agenda."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": "00:16:47.200",
      "end": "00:16:49.120",
      "text": "I want to begin by acknowledging that the City of London"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": "00:16:49.120",
      "end": "00:16:52.190",
      "text": "is situated on the traditional lands of the Anishinaabek,"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": "00:16:52.190",
      "end": "00:16:55.560",
      "text": "Haudenosaunee, Lene Peiwak, and Adwondering."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": "00:16:55.560",
      "end": "00:16:57.760",
      "text": "And we honor and respect the history, languages,"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": "00:16:57.760",
      "end": "00:16:59.770",
      "text": "and culture of the diverse indigenous people"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": "00:16:59.770",
      "end": "00:17:01.920",
      "text": "who call this territory home."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": "00:17:01.920",
      "end": "00:17:05.040",
      "text": "The City of London is currently home to many First Nations,"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": "00:17:05.040",
      "end": "00:17:07.360",
      "text": "M\u00e9tis, and Inuit people."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": "00:17:07.360",
      "end": "00:17:10.560",
      "text": "And as representatives of the people over the City of London,"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": "00:17:10.560",
      "end": "00:17:12.010",
      "text": "we are grateful to have the opportunity"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": "00:17:12.010",
      "end": "00:17:14.410",
      "text": "to work and live in this territory."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": "00:17:14.410",
      "end": "00:17:17.370",
      "text": "I also wish to advise that the City of London"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": "00:17:17.370",
      "end": "00:17:18.870",
      "text": "is committed to making every effort"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": "00:17:18.870",
      "end": "00:17:21.470",
      "text": "to provide alternate formats and communication supports"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": "00:17:21.470",
      "end": "00:17:23.370",
      "text": "for meetings upon request."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": "00:17:23.370",
      "end": "00:17:26.530",
      "text": "And to make a request specific to this meeting, please contact"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": "00:17:26.530",
      "end": "00:17:38.180",
      "text": "csc@london.ca or phone 519-661-2489 extension 2425."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": "00:17:38.180",
      "end": "00:17:40.180",
      "text": "Colleagues, I am just going to begin the meeting"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": "00:17:40.180",
      "end": "00:17:44.330",
      "text": "by looking for any disclosures of pecuniary interest."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": "00:17:44.330",
      "end": "00:17:50.490",
      "text": "Seeing none, we only have one item on the agenda today"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": "00:17:50.490",
      "end": "00:17:54.010",
      "text": "as this is a special meeting, and it is a confidential matter."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": "00:17:54.010",
      "end": "00:17:58.670",
      "text": "So I am going to look for a motion to move in camera."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": "00:17:58.670",
      "end": "00:18:00.690",
      "text": "We would by Councillor Trussow and seconded"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": "00:18:00.690",
      "end": "00:18:02.930",
      "text": "by Councillor Ferrera."
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": "00:18:02.930",
      "end": "00:18:08.580",
      "text": "And we will open the vote on that."
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": "00:18:08.580",
      "end": "00:18:19.830",
      "text": "I vote yes."
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": "00:18:19.830",
      "end": "00:18:23.740",
      "text": "Holding the vote, the motion carries six to zero."
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": "00:18:23.740",
      "end": "00:18:24.870",
      "text": "Thank you, colleagues."
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": "00:18:24.870",
      "end": "00:18:27.570",
      "text": "So we will just have to adjust the room."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": "00:18:27.570",
      "end": "00:18:29.390",
      "text": "So I will just advise members of the public."
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": "00:18:29.390",
      "end": "00:18:31.970",
      "text": "We are moving in confidential session"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": "00:18:31.970",
      "end": "00:18:35.550",
      "text": "for personal matters, identifiable individuals."
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": "00:18:35.550",
      "end": "00:18:37.840",
      "text": "And we will report out from that in public session"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": "00:18:37.840",
      "end": "00:21:10.370",
      "text": "at the end of this meeting."
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": "00:21:10.370",
      "end": "00:21:12.970",
      "text": "Okay, colleagues, the clerk advises we can resume."
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": "00:21:12.970",
      "end": "00:21:14.670",
      "text": "So I will call on Vice Chair Trussow"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": "00:21:14.670",
      "end": "00:21:17.990",
      "text": "to report out from our confidential session."
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": "00:21:17.990",
      "end": "00:21:20.900",
      "text": "The Corporate Services Committee held a special meeting"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": "00:21:20.900",
      "end": "00:21:26.130",
      "text": "on October 30th for the purpose of regarding a matter"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": "00:21:26.130",
      "end": "00:21:29.190",
      "text": "pertaining to an identifiable individual"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": "00:21:29.190",
      "end": "00:21:31.650",
      "text": "in an employment-related matter"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": "00:21:31.650",
      "end": "00:21:35.130",
      "text": "with advice or recommendations from the officer"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": "00:21:35.130",
      "end": "00:21:36.840",
      "text": "and employees of the corporation,"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": "00:21:36.840",
      "end": "00:21:40.020",
      "text": "including communications necessary for that purpose"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": "00:21:40.020",
      "end": "00:21:42.270",
      "text": "and progress was made."
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": "00:21:42.270",
      "end": "00:21:43.840",
      "text": "Thank you, Vice Chair."
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": "00:21:43.840",
      "end": "00:21:47.240",
      "text": "And colleagues, we just need a motion now to adjourn."
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": "00:21:47.240",
      "end": "00:21:49.490",
      "text": "Moved by Councillor Stevenson and seconded"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": "00:21:49.490",
      "end": "00:21:51.030",
      "text": "by Councillor McAllister."
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": "00:21:51.030",
      "end": "00:21:52.020",
      "text": "We can do that by hand."
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": "00:21:52.020",
      "end": "00:21:55.620",
      "text": "All those in favor?"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": "00:21:55.620",
      "end": "00:21:57.800",
      "text": "Motion carries."
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": "00:21:57.800",
      "end": "00:21:58.780",
      "text": "Thank you, colleagues."
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": "00:21:58.780",
      "end": "00:21:59.490",
      "text": "We are adjourned."
    }
  ],
